00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:06.400
And they've been you know, it's typically
CNN asking some of the tougher questions.

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:08.350
And good for them during the press briefings.

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:11.370
It's sometimes CNN that we'll just skip Trump's
part altogether.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.860
I guess CNN wants to trigger Trump.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:19.330
You're going to really trigger him by running
a real time ticker, correcting his lies.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.211
MSNBC, to their credit, I believe they did
